      "text": "JB on Kevin Huerter: \"There’s so many different ways he can make you pay. He can pass, he can score, he can shoot, he can handle the ball and playmake. And then defensively ... he takes challenges and does a great job on one on one situations and team defensive schemes as well.\"",
